<title>ITALY: SOCCER-URUGUAY'S RECOBA REPORTED TO BE MOVING TO INTER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-URUGUAY'S RECOBA REPORTED TO BE MOVING TO INTER.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter Milan have signed 21-year-old Uruguayan international striker Alvaro Recoba from Nacional Montevideo, the Gazzetta dello Sport newspaper reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;Recoba is Inter's,&quot; the paper declared in a front-page headline, saying the club's president Massimo Moratti had announced the deal, reportedly worth $4.2 million.</p>
</text>
